## Why This Infrastructure Is Better

This infrastructure improves the previous design by:

* Adding another server for additional capacity
* Using two load balancers for higher availability
* Separating web, application, and database components
* Allowing each component to scale independently
* Reducing resource competition
* Improving maintainability and reliability
